      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nThis substantial five-bedroom detached residence extends to approximately 196 sq. m. and presents an excellent opportunity to acquire a spacious family home of exceptional quality. Ideally located within the heart of Ballinalee village, the property is presented in excellent condition throughout and has been completed to a high standard, offering generous and versatile accommodation with an impressive level of finish.\n\nOn entering the property, a welcoming entrance hall leads to a bright and spacious living room, complemented by a separate sitting room providing an additional comfortable reception space. The well-appointed kitchen/dining area forms the heart of the home, offering excellent space for both everyday family living and entertaining. A separate utility room and guest WC further enhance the practicality of the ground floor. A particularly attractive feature is the generously proportioned bedroom on the ground floor, which provides excellent flexibility for family living and could also be ideally suited as a guest bedroom, home office, playroom or additional reception space.\n\nUpstairs, the property offers four further bedrooms, providing excellent accommodation for a growing family. The primary bedroom benefits from its own ensuite, while a well-appointed main bathroom serves the remaining bedrooms. The overall layout provides an excellent balance of living and bedroom accommodation, making this an ideal long-term family home.\n\nExternally, the property is equally impressive. It is surrounded by mature, established gardens which provide a wonderful sense of privacy and tranquillity. A patio area offers an ideal space for outdoor dining and entertaining, while generous off-street parking provides ample space for several cars.\n\nThe location is a key feature of this property. Ballinalee is a small but well-equipped village situated approximately 12 km from Longford town, offering a range of local amenities and services while retaining a welcoming community atmosphere. The property also provides convenient access to the N4, making commuting to Longford and further afield straightforward.\n\nThis is a substantial and beautifully presented family residence offering generous accommodation, excellent outdoor space and a convenient village location. Properties of this calibre and size are rarely brought to the market and early viewing is highly recommended to fully appreciate all that this impressive home has to offer.\n\n\nBER: B\nServices: Main Water/ Sewerage"
